  "evidence_limits": [
    "This continuation shows a discovered service and manual UI drafts, followed by two visibly rejected create requests. No successful session, captured variables, source retrieval or source mapping is demonstrated.",
    "Both baseline and plain-message control show the real error toast: Error creating logpoint: The instrumentation is not valid, please check your configuration. The requests are not silent failures, and their underlying cause is unresolved.",
    "Line 9999 was accepted only as a draft and was not submitted. Zero, negative and alphabetic input remained disabled. The negative entry is brief in the original motion.",
    "The initial template attempt was automatically balanced by the editor. Removing the closing brace disabled Start; correcting the template enabled it.",
    "The integration observation is interrupted-flow recovery after the original consent form had waited about 75 minutes. It is not evidence about fresh-install behavior. GitHub account/repository pages are withheld from this motion package.",
    "The configuration footage shows Not Connected and the selected service. The empty-state magnifying-glass icon is not a loading spinner. The later settled No environments text was captured after this recording stopped and is not reconstructed into video.",
    "All clocks are UTC reconstructed from the recorder start. The archived continuous sections play at original speed; omitted time is explicitly listed. No screenshots or generated/reconstructed UI substitute for motion.",
